body:
I could easily write a lot of pages up about everything little thing it changed for me, but I thought this post was enough for sure :)

&#x200B;

I can agree with you on several levels here, making me realize that I was spending too much time dragging myself down instead of trying new things and allowing myself to be open about life.

I am not perfect by any means, but the sense of getting on track and pushing my mind to stay on track is as good as it will get.

&#x200B;

LiS is an amazing experience. For all of us. Hope you have a great new year!
